MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Introduced a stable cell identifier format (#VSC-xxxxxxxx) using SHA1 hash of the cell's document URI.
- Updated functions to utilize the new copilot-like cell ID for consistent identification across operations.
- Enhanced output serialization to include more detailed artifact summaries and improved text previews.
- Implemented virtual document line range computation for accurate line numbering in notebook cells.
- Refactored notebook source retrieval to support cell targeting via cell ID, improving pagination and output limits.
- Improved summary generation to reflect new conventions and provide clearer execution state descriptions.
- Adjusted utility functions for text previewing to allow customizable character limits.

